---
/**
 * CTASection — final block on most pages. Direct + transitional CTA.
 */
---

<section class="section bg-cumberland-forest text-cumberland-cream">
  <div class="container-rail max-w-3xl text-center">
    <h2>Have a project? Let's start it.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-cumberland-mist">
      Free proof. Fast quote. Friendly humans.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="/start-your-project"
        class="btn bg-cumberland-clay text-white hover:bg-cumberland-clay-dark text-base md:text-lg"
      >
        Start Your Project →
      </a>
      <a
        href="/resources/checklist"
        class="btn bg-transparent border-2 border-cumberland-cream text-cumberland-cream hover:bg-cumberland-cream hover:text-cumberland-ink text-base md:text-lg"
      >
        Get the Free Checklist
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-cumberland-mist">
      Not ready yet? Grab the Project Checklist — file specs, sizing, timelines,
      and what to ask for. One page. No fluff.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
